   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor admin
   * @x-autobe-specification Query discussion_board_admins table with pagination and filtering. Apply grade filter if provided (regular or super). Exclude soft-deleted records where deleted_at is not null. Join with discussion_board_members to include member display name and email in summary. Support sorting by grade, created_at (promotion date), or member display name. Return cursor-based or offset pagination with total count. Filter out administrators with deleted_at set. Validate administrator authentication before query execution.
