   *
   * Only the article author or administrators can add file attachments to an article. The operation validates file type, size limits, and ensures the target article exists and is accessible. Uploaded files are processed and stored according to the file validation policies defined in the business rules.
   *
   * This operation is part of the article attachment management workflow. Users typically create articles first, then add or modify attachments through separate operations. File attachments are distinct from image attachments, supporting different validation rules and processing workflows.
