   *
   * 1. Validate article exists and is not deleted
   * 2. Verify caller is article author or administrator
   * 3. Validate file metadata (name, original_name, mime_type, size, path)
   * 4. Check file size limits per business rules
   * 5. Validate MIME type against allowed file types
   * 6. Create file record with discussion_board_article_id and discussion_board_member_id
   * 7. Set created_at and updated_at timestamps
   * 8. Return created file attachment with full metadata
   *
   * Transaction scope: Single table insert with foreign key validation.
